an achieve  more sustainable solutions for this  world  if men and women work together on the  same level  as you probably know the european union  developed a  750 billion euro recovery plan  called next generation eu we don't  just want to repair our economy  but we want to prepare it for the future  we want a green recovery  more than one third of our investment  will finance our  european green deal objectives  big resources will go into flagship  projects  such as hydrogen valleys  or a renovation way for our buildings  or the installation of one million  charging points for electric cars  so europe will raise its climate  ambition  because it's vital for our planet  and it's good for our economy  we also want a digital recovery  and we will invest 20 percent of next  generation eu  in this we want to bring high-speed  connectivity to every corner of the  european union  during this crisis we have learned how  important this is  businesses of all size can benefit from  investments in artificial intelligence  and then european data economy for  example  so europe wants to shape the digital  transformation  but most importantly  true recovery has to be inclusive  and this will only happen if women enjoy  the very same opportunities as men  and this is why we will put a special  focus  on digital skills every man and every  woman should be equally fit  to contribute to the economy of the  future  the european union will for instance  invest in programs that will encourage  more girls and women towards stem  education most green and digital jobs  are stem jobs good news is  that in europe by now 41  of scientists and engineers are women  but when you look closer at workers in  high-tech  manufacturing four out of five  are men so still a very long way to go  in raising my daughters i have always  told them  there is no such thing as  jobs for men and jobs for women  some of europe's best scientists and  engineers are women  the italian team that recently  discovered water on mars  is led by a woman elena pettinelli  or this year's nobel prize in chemistry  went to emmanuel chachapunte for her  groundbreaking research on genome  the stem key initiative which you have  launched  is great our recovery plan will invest  in the next  generation of european women in stem  so if not no then when  this also means that women and men  in the jobs market should enjoy the very  same rights and opportunities  and this does not always have to be done  with a rebuking finger  sometimes even clever incentives are  enough  let me tell you a story when i was  family minister in my home country  germany  i introduced incentives for fathers  to take at least two months of parental  leave  after the birth of a child today  more than a third of german fathers take  time with their baby at home and they  love it and it gives the mother the  opportunity to resume her career  and it paves the way for an equal  partnership  with reconciliation of work and family  for both  parents  in the last five years only nine more eu  countries have  either created or extended paternity  leave  the latest to do so was france just two  weeks  a few weeks ago this is the way  maternity and paternity  should never be perceived as being  alternative  to having a career and we can change  culture and customs in  all our societies with the right laws  and yes  with right role models as you are  this kind of change can take time  when i was elected president of the  european commission i  promised that my commission would be the  first  gender balanced one in our history  we asked every european country to  present a man  and a woman as candidates for each post  i tell you it was not easy  but today as the first female president  of the european commission  i lead a team that is gender balanced  so everything can change with a bit of  perseverance  and there is something i have learned in  20 years of politics  leadership is very often about  finding the silver lining in every cloud  yes today the world is in the middle of  a storm  but with the right steer we can design a  fair recovery for all  and a more inclusive world you can count  on me  as i know i can count on you it is a  time for  change let's make it happen together  thank you
 

